    <h1 class="h2" style="margin-top:12px">Terms of use (draft)</h1>
    <p>This draft outlines the intended terms for the demonstration release. It is not a binding agreement.</p>
    <h2>Demonstration only</h2>
    <p>The workspace runs against a simulated backend. Outputs labelled as fixtures or samples are not generated from your inputs. Prices are illustrative and no payment is processed.</p>
    <h2>Your content</h2>
    <p>Reference images you upload stay in your browser. You retain all rights to them.</p>
    <h2>Sample media</h2>
    <p>Product fixtures and sample clips are authored by Annie 3D for demonstration and may be used to evaluate the product.</p>
    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>The demonstration is provided as is, for evaluation.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
